# v0.204.0-beta Release Notes

Release: v0.204.0-beta
Date: 2026-08-18
Tag: v0.204.0-beta

## Compiler

- C emit + `chs_rt` + gcc remains the product path.
- C: sum/Result typecheck and emit work, plus the committed
  control-flow `#line` / caret floors.
- LLVM: match-expr / Result / try emit on the side LLVM path.
  Not LLVM-as-gcc. Not LLVM-linked `check oodac/main.oo`.
- WASM: print-fold and named print/if/int smokes. Dummy `end`
  remains on some functions. Not a complete WASM backend.
- x86: greet fold and named x86 smokes on the OPEN-69 path.
- AArch64: side hello floor (`emit-aarch64` hello `.s`).
  Product dispatch and qemu stay later.

## CLI

- PM store search / extra registry commands.

## Pin

- CLI `ooda version` prints `0.204.0-beta`.
- `install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN`, `std.pin`, `ooda.pkg`, install layout default
  match `v0.204.0-beta`.

## Other branches

- Fail-closed policy / untrusted / hop-2 send gates live on
  `feat/mindvirus-on-63796`. They are not this tag’s `main` tree.

## Residual

- Public install is the checkout XDG installer (`ooda install`).
- Domain folders in `ooda/std` are not a volume cert.
